# Every file byte for byte on every host: no line ending converted at checkout. What the
# binary carries (include_bytes!, include_str!) and what tests hold to oracles must be the
# bytes their digests and answers were taken of; a Windows checkout's CRLF made the carried
# TUF target 6,913 bytes where targets.json pins its 6,787 and their sha256.
* -text
# Batch files as cmd.exe reads them, as a Windows checkout gave them before.
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Byte-exact test archives.
*.tar binary
